# "Under your control": Bot1 reanimates Bot2's Elvish Mystic (discarded to hand size, the card in Bot2's graveyard), losing 1 life. It is Bot1's creature while it lives, and when Bot1 kills it with Lightning Bolt it is put into its owner's
# graveyard (CR 400.3), Bot2's, not Bot1's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Reanimate
Lightning Bolt
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Elvish Mystic
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
